;; Oman public holidays 2020-2040: external gold for OM.
;; Regenerate: uv run --no-project --with holidays==0.109 python -I scripts/generate_mena_holiday_gold.py OM
;; :days lists every holiday as (YEAR MONTH DAY NAME); any other day is not one.
(
 :country "OM"
 :generated "2026-11-28"
 :from 2020 :to 2040
 :note "Official holidays of Oman (public and private sector): Royal Decree 56/2020, 88/2022 (Accession Day from 2023) and 15/2025 (National Day 20-21 November), at the dates the Ministry of Labour announced each year 2020-2026 (Oman News Agency), including the moved National Day and Accession Day and the weekend compensation days. Renaissance Day (23 July) ends after 2019. 2027-2040 are provisional: the statutory days and tabular estimates."
 :weekends ((nil 4 5) ((2013 5 1) 5 6))
