 (
  (:title "المرسوم السلطاني رقم 56/91 بتحديد أيام العطلات الرسمية (Royal Decree 56/91 Determining the Dates of Official Holidays)" :uri "https://qanoon.om/p/1996/rd1996076/"
   :text "Earlier government holiday list (superseded 1996). Out of the research window.")
  (:title "قرارات وزير ديوان البلاط السلطاني رئيس مجلس الخدمة المدنية السنوية بإجازة 23 يوليو (annual Renaissance Day decisions of the Minister of the Diwan of Royal Court, Chairman of the Civil Service Council)" :uri "https://www.omanobserver.om/ampArticle/28285"
   :text "23 July Renaissance Day (يوم النهضة المباركة) holiday, one day, by annual decision.")
  (:title "المرسوم السلطاني رقم 56/2020 بتحديد أيام الإجازات الرسمية (Royal Decree 56/2020 Determining the Official Holidays)" :uri "https://qanoon.om/p/2020/rd2020056/"
   :text "Same list as RD 76/96 (Hijri NY 1 Muharram, Mawlid 12 Rabi I, Isra wal Mi'raj 27 Rajab, National Day 18-19 Nov, Eid al-Fitr 29 Ramadan-3 Shawwal, Eid al-Adha 9-12 Dhu al-Hijja, one-day weekend compensation, Friday-first-day-of-Eid compensation, National Day date amendable) but now for the state apparatus, other legal persons AND the private sector. Repeals RD 76/96. In force from issue (2020-04-20). No Renaissance Day, no Accession Day. Cache: om/qanoon-rd2020-56.html, om/ona-ar-112-show-377750.html.")
  (:title "المرسوم السلطاني رقم 88/2022 بتحديد أيام الإجازات الرسمية (Royal Decree 88/2022 Determining the Official Holidays)" :uri "https://qanoon.om/p/2022/rd2022088/"
   :text "Repeals RD 56/2020. Same list (National Day still 18 and 19 November) plus (هـ) يوم تولي السلطان مقاليد الحكم في البلاد -- the Sultan's Accession Day, given WITHOUT a date (the anniversary is 11 January). Compensation now applies to all listed holidays; the date of ANY listed holiday may be modified in the public interest. Eids unchanged. Cache: om/qanoon-rd2022-88.html, om/ona-ar-85-show-411345.html, om/ona-en-102-show-111049.html.")
  (:title "المرسوم السلطاني رقم 15/2025 بتعديل بعض أحكام المرسوم السلطاني رقم 88/2022 (Royal Decree 15/2025 amending RD 88/2022)" :uri "https://qanoon.om/p/2025/rd2025015/"
   :text "Replaces item (d): 'اليوم الوطني لسلطنة عمان' (National Day of the Sultanate of Oman) on 20 and 21 November (was 18-19 November). Cache: om/qanoon-rd2025-15.html.")
  (:title "مجلس الوزراء يقرّ سياسة الإعلان المُسبق عن تحديد مواعيد الإجازات الوطنية والدينية سنويًّا (Council of Ministers policy of advance annual announcement of national and religious holidays)" :uri "https://omannews.gov.om/topics/ar/3/show/461682"
   :text "From 2026 the Ministry of Labour publishes at the start of each Gregorian year the dates of Accession Day, National Day, Isra wal Mi'raj, Hijri New Year and Mawlid; the two Eids stay announced after the moon-sighting committee. Lists the 2026 dates.")
